WEBVTT

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.665
called "The Pollinators."

00:02:00.665 --> 00:02:02.881
It's about bees and other
pollinators in our environment

00:02:02.881 --> 00:02:05.250
and why they're so important.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:07.860
If plants aren't pollinated by the pollinators,

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.769
then all creatures, including ourselves,

00:02:09.769 --> 00:02:12.285
that depend on these plants, would starve.

00:02:12.285 --> 00:02:14.493
So I decided to take these cool creatures

00:02:14.493 --> 00:02:18.312
and make a superhero team.

00:02:18.312 --> 00:02:22.867
(Applause)

00:02:26.202 --> 00:02:29.376
(Foot stomp)

00:02:29.376 --> 00:02:33.517
(Music)